```

The MySQL, PostgreSQL, and SQLite backends each return a `store.Driver` from their constructors (for example `store/db/postgres/postgres.go`, `store/db/mysql/mysql.go`, `store/db/sqlite/sqlite.go`), and `store/db/db.go` selects among them via `NewDBDriver`.
